  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Updating the dependencies**\n\nI\'ve just updated `@google/genai` to `^3.3.0`. Now, I need to update `metadata.json`, `index.html`, and `package.json`. In `package.json`, I\'ll update the `\"dev\"` script to `tsx server.ts` and the `\"start\"` script to `node server.ts` with `NODE_ENV=production`, or I\'ll check for the existence of `dist` in `server.ts` to enable `node server.ts` to serve the `dist` folder.\n\n\n**Refining Build Logic**\n\nI\'ve refined the build logic; I\'ll now check if the `dist` folder exists to determine if Vite middleware should be used in development. I\'ll maintain `\"dev\": \"tsx server.ts\"` and `\"start\": \"node server.ts\"`, with the logic within `server.ts` to serve `dist` in production or use Vite middleware in development. I\'m also implementing Tailwind v4, with custom `@theme` tokens for fonts and subtle styling. Finally, I have the Express server fully set up with the needed API endpoints.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
