  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Organizing Project Structure**\n\nI\'m now establishing the core structure for our client codebase under `/src`. Specifically, I\'m setting up a `src/types.ts` file. This file will house meticulously crafted TypeScript types for essential components such as `StoryBook`, `StoryPage`, `VoiceOption`, `ImageSize` (with enumerated string literals for size), `ArtStyleOption`, and `ChatMessage`.\n\n\n**Defining Starter Stories**\n\nI\'m presently focused on the `src/data/starterStories.ts` file, where I\'m crafting the content of multi-page starter picture books. I\'m leveraging specific image asset paths for the first pages and including calls-to-action buttons like \"Illustrate This Page.\" I\'m aiming for an interactive experience, including an easel state and a history strip of image variants.\n\n\n**Constructing Top Bar**\n\nI\'m currently designing the top bar layout and functionality. Zone 1 will feature the \"Loom & Lantern\" wordmark, Zone 2 will have four text links, and Zone 3 will have a prominent \"New Story\" button. This will be the header of every page. The top bar will make use of Fraunces font.\n\n\n**Designing Page Features**\n\nI am now structuring the interface for our story pages. I\'m focusing on the Right Page, which will contain the story prose and read-aloud functionality. This will include metadata, headings, and an audio player for read-aloud narration with voice selection options (Kore, Puck, Charon, Zephyr, and Fenrir) and adjustable playback features, plus a Gallery Strip on the left if multiple illustrations are available.\n\n\n**Refining Page Interaction**\n\nI\'m now integrating enhanced features into the story page layout. I\'m introducing a \"Wonder Prompt Callout\" with the curiosity question and a button to interact with the Story Buddy. I\'m also finalizing the \"Bottom Page Turner Bar,\" which includes navigation controls and an \"Illustrate All Missing Pages\" button.\n\nI am now focusing on the Story Library component. I\'m building a three-column shelf displaying available picture books, including covers and metadata for each. I\'m also working on the CreateStoryModal component, which handles new story creation with options for age band, page count, and art style.\n\n\n**Developing Story Buddy**\n\nI\'m now structuring the Story Buddy component, intending for it to be docked cleanly. The design includes a role and model selector for four distinct models: Story Companion, Deep Wonder Guide, Adventure Architect, and Quick Word Helper. It will maintain multi-turn conversation history per session, with a scrollable message thread. A \"Listen\" button for audio responses, using `gemini-3.8-flash-tts`, will be integrated into every buddy reply.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_2186143299753012501"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"export type ImageSize = \'1K\' | \'2K\' | \'4K\';\\n\\nexport type VoiceName = \'Kore\' | \'Puck\' | \'Charon\' | \'Fenrir\' | \'Zephyr\';\\n\\nexport type ChatModelId =\\n  | \'gemini-4-hydrogen\'\\n  | \'gemini-4-carbon\'\\n  | \'gemini-4-argon\'\\n  | \'gemini-3.1-flash-lite\';\\n\\nexport interface StoryPage {\\n  id: string;\\n  pageNumber: number;\\n  heading: string;\\n  text: string;\\n  illustrationPrompt: string;\\n  wonderQuestion: string;\\n  imageUrl?: string;\\n  imageHistory?: Array<{\\n    url: string;\\n    size: ImageSize;\\n    style: string;\\n    createdAt: number;\\n  }>;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface StoryBook {\\n  id: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  subtitle: string;\\n  ageBand: string;\\n  artStyle: string;\\n  readingMinutes: number;\\n  createdAt: number;\\n  isCustom?: boolean;\\n  pages: StoryPage[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ChatMessage {\\n  id: string;\\n  role: \'user\' | \'model\';\\n  text: string;\\n  model?: ChatModelId;\\n  roleLabel?: string;\\n  timestamp: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport const ART_STYLES = [\\n  \'Warm Watercolor & Gouache\',\\n  \'Cut-Paper Collage\',\\n  \'Pen & Ink Storybook Wash\',\\n  \'Soft Colored Pencil & Chalk\',\\n] as const;\\n\\nexport const VOICE_OPTIONS: Array<{\\n  id: VoiceName;\\n  label: string;\\n  stylePrompt: string;\\n}> = [\\n  {\\n    id: \'Kore\',\\n    label: \'Warm Storyteller\',\\n    stylePrompt:\\n      \'Warm, gentle, expressive children\342\200\231s storybook narrator with clear cheerful pacing and soft pauses\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'Puck\',\\n    label: \'Playful Sprite\',\\n    stylePrompt:\\n      \'Playful, bright, animated children\342\200\231s storyteller full of curiosity and smiling energy\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'Charon\',\\n    label: \'Gentle Grandpa Owl\',\\n    stylePrompt:\\n      \'Calm, cozy, wise grandfatherly bedtime storyteller with unhurried comforting cadence\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'Zephyr\',\\n    label: \'Breezy Dreamer\',\\n    stylePrompt:\\n      \'Soft, melodic, soothing bedtime narrator reading gently under starlight\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'Fenrir\',\\n    label: \'Bold Explorer\',\\n    stylePrompt:\\n      \'Lively, adventurous, theatrical storyteller with vivid expression for grand discoveries\',\\n  },\\n];\\n\\nexport const BUDDY_ROLES: Array<{\\n  model: ChatModelId;\\n  title: string;\\n  subtitle: string;\\n  starterPrompts: string[];\\n}> = [\\n  {\\n    model: \'gemini-4-hydrogen\',\\n    title: \'Story Companion\',\\n    subtitle: \'Friendly everyday chat about characters and feelings\',\\n    starterPrompts: [\\n      \'What is the main character feeling right now?\',\\n      \'Tell me a fun detail hidden in this scene.\',\\n      \'Who is your favorite character in this book?\',\\n    ],\\n  },\\n  {\\n    model: \'gemini-4-carbon\',\\n    title: \'Deep Wonder Guide\',\\n    subtitle: \'Thoughtful explanations for big \\\"why\\\" questions\',\\n    starterPrompts: [\\n      \'Why does nature work like it does in this story?\',\\n      \'What big lesson can we learn from this page?\',\\n      \'How would things change if the hero made a different choice?\',\\n    ],\\n  },\\n  {\\n    model: \'gemini-4-argon\',\\n    title: \'Adventure Architect\',\\n    subtitle: \'Interactive choose-your-path twists and story puzzles\',\\n    starterPrompts: [\\n      \'Give me two wild twists for what happens next!\',\\n      \'Play a 3-clue riddle game about this page.\',\\n      \'Let us pretend I step right into this picture!\',\\n    ],\\n  },\\n  {\\n    model: \'gemini-3.1-flash-lite\',\\n    title: \'Quick Word Helper\',\\n    subtitle: \'Instant kid-friendly word meanings and rhymes\',\\n    starterPrompts: [\\n      \'Pick a tricky word on this page and explain it simply.\',\\n      \'Give me 4 playful rhymes for a word in this story.\',\\n      \'Help me sound out the longest word here.\',\\n    ],\\n  },\\n];\\n\", \"Description\":\"Define shared TypeScript types and model/voice/style presets\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/types.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating src/types.ts\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create shared application types\"}"
