  planner_response {
    response: "I built **Loom & Lantern**, an illustrated read-aloud storybook application for children with server-side Gemini integration.\n\n### Features Implemented\n- **Open-Book Spread & Page-by-Page Illustration Studio**:\n  - Pre-loaded with three multi-page picture books (*Barnaby and the Moonlit Lantern*, *The Cloud-Maker\342\200\231s Whale*, and *Mina\342\200\231s Whispering Garden*) featuring generated opening illustrations.\n  - Generates new illustrations for any page via `/api/illustrate` using **`gemini-3-pro-image-preview`**, with a **`1K` / `2K` / `4K`** resolution selector, art medium picker, custom scene detail input, saved version switcher, and batch painting for unpainted pages.\n- **Read-Aloud Narration**:\n  - Reads each page aloud via `/api/tts` using **`gemini-3.8-flash-tts`** with five narrator voices (`Kore`, `Puck`, `Charon`, `Zephyr`, `Fenrir`), playback speed controls (`0.85\303\227`, `1\303\227`, `1.15\303\227`), progress tracking, and an optional auto-turn mode to read through the entire book.\n- **Multi-Turn Story Buddy Chatbot**:\n  - Maintains scrollable conversation history grounded in the active book and page via `/api/chat`, with distinct system instructions across four specialized roles:\n    - **Story Companion (`gemini-4-hydrogen`)** for general character and story conversations\n    - **Deep Wonder Guide (`gemini-4-carbon`)** for deep reasoning about nature, themes, and \"why\" questions\n    - **Adventure Architect (`gemini-4-argon`)** for interactive choose-your-path twists and story riddles\n    - **Quick Word Helper (`gemini-3.1-flash-lite`)** for fast word definitions, rhymes, and phonics clues\n  - Includes one-click **Read Reply Aloud** playback on Story Buddy responses.\n- **Custom Story Creator**:\n  - Generates new 3\342\200\2236 page children\'s picture books with chapter headings, read-aloud prose, illustration prompts, and wonder questions using `gemini-4-hydrogen`, with optional automatic illustration generation for every page.\n\n### Verification\n- `npm run build` (`vite build`) and `npm run lint` (`tsc --noEmit`) passed with zero errors, and the Express + Vite server responded cleanly on `/api/health`.\n- Because paid API key selection was declined during setup, if `gemini-3-pro-image-preview`, `gemini-4-carbon`, or `gemini-4-argon` returns a quota or permission error at runtime, you can select a billing-enabled key in **Settings > Secrets**."
    thinking: "**Confirming System Readiness**\n\nI\'ve just verified the system\'s readiness. The \"ok\":true message is showing on port 3000. Node v22.23.2 is running smoothly. TypeScript check passed flawlessly with zero errors, and the Vite build succeeded cleanly. The requested functionalities are fully implemented, verified, and running as expected!\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I built **Loom & Lantern**, an illustrated read-aloud storybook application for children with server-side Gemini integration.\n\n### Features Implemented\n- **Open-Book Spread & Page-by-Page Illustration Studio**:\n  - Pre-loaded with three multi-page picture books (*Barnaby and the Moonlit Lantern*, *The Cloud-Maker\342\200\231s Whale*, and *Mina\342\200\231s Whispering Garden*) featuring generated opening illustrations.\n  - Generates new illustrations for any page via `/api/illustrate` using **`gemini-3-pro-image-preview`**, with a **`1K` / `2K` / `4K`** resolution selector, art medium picker, custom scene detail input, saved version switcher, and batch painting for unpainted pages.\n- **Read-Aloud Narration**:\n  - Reads each page aloud via `/api/tts` using **`gemini-3.8-flash-tts`** with five narrator voices (`Kore`, `Puck`, `Charon`, `Zephyr`, `Fenrir`), playback speed controls (`0.85\303\227`, `1\303\227`, `1.15\303\227`), progress tracking, and an optional auto-turn mode to read through the entire book.\n- **Multi-Turn Story Buddy Chatbot**:\n  - Maintains scrollable conversation history grounded in the active book and page via `/api/chat`, with distinct system instructions across four specialized roles:\n    - **Story Companion (`gemini-4-hydrogen`)** for general character and story conversations\n    - **Deep Wonder Guide (`gemini-4-carbon`)** for deep reasoning about nature, themes, and \"why\" questions\n    - **Adventure Architect (`gemini-4-argon`)** for interactive choose-your-path twists and story riddles\n    - **Quick Word Helper (`gemini-3.1-flash-lite`)** for fast word definitions, rhymes, and phonics clues\n  - Includes one-click **Read Reply Aloud** playback on Story Buddy responses.\n- **Custom Story Creator**:\n  - Generates new 3\342\200\2236 page children\'s picture books with chapter headings, read-aloud prose, illustration prompts, and wonder questions using `gemini-4-hydrogen`, with optional automatic illustration generation for every page.\n\n### Verification\n- `npm run build` (`vite build`) and `npm run lint` (`tsc --noEmit`) passed with zero errors, and the Express + Vite server responded cleanly on `/api/health`.\n- Because paid API key selection was declined during setup, if `gemini-3-pro-image-preview`, `gemini-4-carbon`, or `gemini-4-argon` returns a quota or permission error at runtime, you can select a billing-enabled key in **Settings > Secrets**."
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 544646680
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
